{"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "expand", "ucas": "expand (x + 1)^3", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "expand", "input": "(x + 1)^3", "result": "x^3 + 3x^2 + 3x + 1"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "normal_form", "passed": true, "text": "both sides have the same normal form"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "both sides have the same normal form over Q"}, "files": [], "text": "expand (x + 1)^3\n  = x^3 + 3x^2 + 3x + 1\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}
{"id": 2, "ok": true, "cmd": "factor", "ucas": "factor x^6 - 1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "factor", "input": "x^6 - 1", "result": "(x - 1)*(x + 1)*(x^2 + x + 1)*(x^2 - x + 1)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "normal_form", "passed": true, "text": "both sides have the same normal form"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "both sides have the same normal form over Q"}, "files": [], "text": "factor x^6 - 1\n  = (x - 1)*(x + 1)*(x^2 + x + 1)*(x^2 - x + 1)\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n  (factors are irreducible over the rationals)\n"}
{"id": 3, "ok": true, "cmd": "simplify", "ucas": "simplify (x^2 - 1)/(x - 1)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "simplify", "input": "(x^2 - 1)/(x - 1)", "result": "x + 1"}, "notes": [], "conditions": ["x - 1 != 0"], "checks": [{"kind": "normal_form", "passed": true, "text": "both sides have the same normal form"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "both sides have the same normal form over Q"}, "files": [], "text": "simplify (x^2 - 1)/(x - 1)\n  = x + 1\n  holds where x - 1 != 0 (cancelled there)\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}
{"id": 4, "ok": true, "cmd": "simplify", "ucas": "simplify sqrt(x^2)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "simplify", "input": "sqrt(x^2)", "result": "abs(x)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "numeric", "points": 64, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "simplify sqrt(x^2)\n  = abs(x)\n  check: equal at 64 sample points (max relative difference 0)\n"}
{"id": 5, "ok": true, "cmd": "together", "ucas": "together 1/x + 1/(x + 1)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "together", "input": "1/x + 1/(x + 1)", "result": "(2x + 1)/(x*(x + 1))"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "normal_form", "passed": true, "text": "both sides have the same normal form"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "both sides have the same normal form over Q"}, "files": [], "text": "together 1/x + 1/(x + 1)\n  = (2x + 1)/(x*(x + 1))\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}
{"id": 6, "ok": true, "cmd": "cancel", "ucas": "cancel (x^2 - 4)/(x + 2)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "cancel", "input": "(x^2 - 4)/(x + 2)", "result": "x - 2"}, "notes": [], "conditions": ["x + 2 != 0"], "checks": [{"kind": "normal_form", "passed": true, "text": "both sides have the same normal form"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "both sides have the same normal form over Q"}, "files": [], "text": "cancel (x^2 - 4)/(x + 2)\n  = x - 2\n  holds where x + 2 != 0 (cancelled there)\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}
{"id": 7, "ok": true, "cmd": "collect", "ucas": "collect a*x + b*x + a in x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "collect", "input": "a*x + b*x + a", "result": "(a + b)*x + a"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "normal_form", "passed": true, "text": "both sides have the same normal form"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "both sides have the same normal form over Q"}, "files": [], "text": "collect a*x + b*x + a\n  = (a + b)*x + a\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}
{"id": 8, "ok": true, "cmd": "apart", "ucas": "apart 1/(x^2 - 1)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "apart", "input": "1/(x^2 - 1)", "result": "1/(2(x - 1)) - 1/(2(x + 1))"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "normal_form", "passed": true, "text": "both sides have the same normal form"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "both sides have the same normal form over Q"}, "files": [], "text": "apart 1/(x^2 - 1)\n  = 1/(2(x - 1)) - 1/(2(x + 1))\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}
{"id": 9, "ok": true, "cmd": "gcd", "ucas": "gcd x^2 - 1, x^2 + 2x + 1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "gcd", "p": "x^2 - 1", "q": "x^2 + 2x + 1", "result": "x + 1"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "exact_division", "passed": true, "text": "divides both, cofactors coprime"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "exact division"}, "files": [], "text": "gcd x^2 - 1, x^2 + 2x + 1\n  = x + 1\n  check: it divides both exactly, and the cofactors are coprime\n  (normalized: integer coefficients without a common factor, leading coefficient positive)\n"}
{"id": 10, "ok": true, "cmd": "lcm", "ucas": "lcm x^2 - 1, x + 1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "lcm", "p": "x^2 - 1", "q": "x + 1", "result": "(x - 1)*(x + 1)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "lcm x^2 - 1, x + 1\n  = (x - 1)*(x + 1)\n    = x^2 - 1\n  check: both divide it exactly\n"}
{"id": 11, "ok": true, "cmd": "resultant", "ucas": "resultant x^2 - 2, x - y in x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "resultant", "p": "x^2 - 2", "q": "x - y", "var": "x", "result": "y^2 - 2"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "resultant x^2 - 2, x - y\n  in x: y^2 - 2\n"}
{"id": 12, "ok": true, "cmd": "discriminant", "ucas": "discriminant a*x^2 + b*x + c in x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "discriminant", "input": "a*x^2 + b*x + c", "var": "x", "degree": 2, "result": "b^2 - 4a*c"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "discriminant a*x^2 + b*x + c\n  in x (degree 2): b^2 - 4a*c\n  check: at sample values of the coefficients the numeric polynomial's discriminant is -0.7279, the formula gives -0.7279 (agrees)\n"}
{"id": 13, "ok": true, "cmd": "divide", "ucas": "divide x^3 + 1 by x + 2", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "divide", "p": "x^3 + 1", "q": "x + 2", "var": "x", "quotient": "x^2 - 2x + 4", "remainder": "-7"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "normal_form", "passed": true, "text": "both sides have the same normal form"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "both sides have the same normal form over Q"}, "files": [], "text": "divide x^3 + 1, x + 2\n  quotient x^2 - 2x + 4, remainder -7\n  (in x: P = Q*quotient + remainder, deg remainder < 1)\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}
{"id": 14, "ok": true, "cmd": "quo", "ucas": "quo x^3 + 1, x + 2", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "quo", "p": "x^3 + 1", "q": "x + 2", "var": "x", "quotient": "x^2 - 2x + 4", "remainder": "-7"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "normal_form", "passed": true, "text": "both sides have the same normal form"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "both sides have the same normal form over Q"}, "files": [], "text": "quo x^3 + 1, x + 2\n  = x^2 - 2x + 4\n  (in x: P = Q*quotient + remainder, deg remainder < 1)\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}
{"id": 15, "ok": true, "cmd": "rem", "ucas": "rem x^3 + 1, x + 2", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "rem", "p": "x^3 + 1", "q": "x + 2", "var": "x", "quotient": "x^2 - 2x + 4", "remainder": "-7"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "normal_form", "passed": true, "text": "both sides have the same normal form"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "both sides have the same normal form over Q"}, "files": [], "text": "rem x^3 + 1, x + 2\n  = -7\n  (in x: P = Q*quotient + remainder, deg remainder < 1)\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}
{"id": 16, "ok": true, "cmd": "solve", "ucas": "solve x^2 - 5x + 6 = 0", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "solve", "equations": ["x^2 - 5x + 6 = 0"], "unknowns": ["x"], "solutions": [{"x": "2", "value": 2, "exact": true, "multiplicity": 1}, {"x": "3", "value": 3, "exact": true, "multiplicity": 1}], "complex_solutions": 0}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "substitution", "points": 2, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "each solution substituted back"}], "files": [], "text": "solve x^2 - 5x + 6 = 0 for x\n  x = 2\n  x = 3\n  check: each solution substituted (2 values): residual 0\n"}
{"id": 17, "ok": true, "cmd": "solve", "ucas": "solve sin x = 1/2", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "solve", "equations": ["sin x = 1/2"], "unknowns": ["x"], "solutions": [{"x": "pi/6 + 2pi*k", "value": 0.5235987755982989, "exact": true, "period": 6.283185307179586, "general": "k any integer", "multiplicity": 1}, {"x": "5*pi/6 + 2pi*k", "value": 2.617993877991494, "exact": true, "period": 6.283185307179586, "general": "k any integer", "multiplicity": 1}], "complex_solutions": 0}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "substitution", "points": 10, "max_diff": 9.43689570931383e-16, "passed": true, "text": "each solution substituted back"}], "files": [], "text": "solve sin x = 1/2 for x\n  x = pi/6 + 2pi*k   (k any integer)\n  x = 5*pi/6 + 2pi*k   (k any integer)\n  check: each solution substituted (10 values, k = -2..2): residual 9.4e-16\n"}
{"id": 18, "ok": true, "cmd": "solve", "ucas": "solve sqrt(x + 1) = x - 1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "solve", "equations": ["sqrt(x + 1) = x - 1"], "unknowns": ["x"], "solutions": [{"x": "3", "value": 3, "exact": true, "multiplicity": 1}], "complex_solutions": 0}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "substitution", "points": 1, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "each solution substituted back"}], "files": [], "text": "solve sqrt(x + 1) = x - 1 for x\n  isolating sqrt(x + 1) and squaring: x^2 - 3x = 0\n  extraneous (from squaring, the original equation fails): x = 0\n  x = 3\n  check: each solution substituted (1 value): residual 0\n"}
{"id": 19, "ok": true, "cmd": "solve", "ucas": "solve x + y = 3, x - y = 1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "solve", "equations": ["x + y = 3", "x - y = 1"], "unknowns": ["x", "y"], "solutions": [{"x": "2", "y": "1"}], "free_unknowns": 0}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "substitution", "points": 2, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "solve x + y = 3, x - y = 1 for x, y\n  x = 2\n  y = 1\n  check: substituted into every equation: residual 0\n"}
{"id": 20, "ok": true, "cmd": "solve", "ucas": "solve x + y = 3, 2x + 2y = 6", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "solve", "equations": ["x + y = 3", "2x + 2y = 6"], "unknowns": ["x", "y"], "solutions": [{"x": "3 - y", "y": "free"}], "free_unknowns": 1}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "substitution", "points": 2, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "solve x + y = 3, 2x + 2y = 6 for x, y\n  x = 3 - y\n  y is free (any value)\n  (a family of solutions: 1 free unknown)\n  check: substituted into every equation (free unknowns at two values): residual 0\n"}
{"id": 21, "ok": true, "cmd": "solve", "ucas": "solve a*x^2 + b*x + c = 0 for x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "solve", "equations": ["a*x^2 + b*x + c = 0"], "unknowns": ["x"], "solutions": [{"x": "(-b + sqrt(b^2 - 4a*c))/(2a)"}, {"x": "(-b - sqrt(b^2 - 4a*c))/(2a)"}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": ["a != 0", "b^2 - 4a*c >= 0 (real solutions)"], "checks": [{"kind": "substitution", "points": 42, "max_diff": 1.3589129821411916e-13, "passed": true}, {"kind": "substitution", "points": 42, "max_diff": 1.1546319456101628e-14, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "solve a*x^2 + b*x + c = 0 for x\n  x = (-b + sqrt(b^2 - 4a*c))/(2a)\n  x = (-b - sqrt(b^2 - 4a*c))/(2a)\n  where a != 0 (else the equation is linear)\n  real when the discriminant b^2 - 4a*c >= 0\n  check: x = the first substituted, the equation holds at 42 sample points of the other variables (residual 1.4e-13)\n  check: x = the second substituted, the equation holds at 42 sample points of the other variables (residual 1.2e-14)\n"}
{"id": 22, "ok": true, "cmd": "solve", "ucas": "solve x^2 + y^2 = 5, x - y = 1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "solve", "equations": ["x^2 + y^2 = 5", "x - y = 1"], "unknowns": ["x", "y"], "solutions": [{"x": "-1", "y": "-2"}, {"x": "2", "y": "1"}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "substitution", "points": 2, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "solve x^2 + y^2 = 5, x - y = 1 for x, y\n  eliminating y: the resultant in x is 2(x - 2)*(x + 1)\n  x = -1, y = -2\n  x = 2, y = 1\n  check: 2 solutions substituted into both equations: residual 0\n"}
{"id": 23, "ok": true, "cmd": "substitute", "ucas": "substitute x = 2 in x^2 + y", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "substitute", "input": "x^2 + y", "result": "y + 4"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "normal_form", "passed": true, "text": "both sides have the same normal form"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "both sides have the same normal form over Q"}, "files": [], "text": "x^2 + y with x = 2\n  = y + 4\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}
